  "details": "Got a bug today that I was listed as a quest user with my Index and Full Body.\nCould not join through invite requests and people can't invite me because the game thinks I'm a Quest User (When they are in a PC only world) . Funny enough that Portals shows a \"X\" but I can just go to a PC only world through a portal.\nOne picture shows that I have the Quest thingy below my nametag.\nThe other picture -> I'm in a PC only World. The portal that is shown in the picture is that world I'm in. (A friend dropped it. That why it says \"Rambozotti\" and not me)\nLike I said. I play with a Valve Index for like 8 month now. Never had a Quest before.",
